- **Hand-written harness** (16,359 lines): 84 patterns × 25 subjects across [38;5;10mpcre2_match[0m/[38;5;10mpcre2_dfa_match[0m, every [38;5;10mpattern_info[0m request, all substring extractors, 17 substitution modes, conversion, config, all 200+ error messages, contexts, callouts, limits, bad UTF, edge cases.[0m[0m
- **Targeted tests**: DFA workspace sizing/restart/shortest, multi-code serialization plus corruption, substitute and substitute-case callouts, custom character tables, recursion guards, long subjects.[0m[0m
- **Randomized fuzzing**: two generators (one general, one biased toward class expressions and backreferences), [1m~670,000 generated patterns[22m across many seeds, comparing compiled-form fingerprints, full serialization hashes, match/DFA ovectors, and substitution output.[0m[0m
